}]},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/PassthroughSubject":{"role":"symbol","title":"PassthroughSubject","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A subject that broadcasts values to multiple consumers without storing a current value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Unlike "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CurrentValueSubject"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PassthroughSubject"},{"type":"text","text":" does not retain the most recent value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"type":"text","text":" that allows multiple tasks to asynchronously consume values and mimics Combine’s PassthroughSubject."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PassthroughSubject"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PassthroughSubject"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/passthroughsubject"}}}